  "author_association": "NONE",
  "body": "Hello, team! Congratulations on producing such an excellent and novel architecture.\n\nI'm a contributor to a project called [Reasoning Gym](https://github.com/open-thought/reasoning-gym), which has difficulty-adjustable dataset generators for more than 100 types of reasoning tasks (math, logic, games, etc.)\n\nWe're very interested to see if HRM can solve some of the harder tasks that other LLMs struggle with, and would like to run some experiments with our dataset generators and your model.\n\nIs this an 'active' GitHub project - would you accept PRs if I added support for Reasoning-Gym to this repo?\n\nThanks so much,\nRich",
